# "Activate only as a sorcery" (CR 307.1, 602.5d): Bot1 has everything for the third ability - three Moxen, an untapped Castle Doom, two Ornithopters to sacrifice - but on
# turn 2, during Bot2's upkeep, it isn't offered. In Bot1's own main phase on turn 3 with Mox Ruby on the stack it isn't offered either. Once the Ruby has resolved and the
# stack is empty, the same activation is offered and makes the Doombot, sacrificing one Ornithopter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Castle Doom
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Castle Doom.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Castle Doom.Activate(Ability: Doombot)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
! Bot1.Battlefield.Castle Doom.Activate(Ability: Doombot)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Castle Doom.Activate(Ability: Doombot)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Tap Castle Doom)
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Castle Doom; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire; Ornithopter; Doombot
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Stack.Count = 0
